  WrittenDialogue: "Hey you! I’ve seen you around before.\nWe don’t know each other too well but I was looking for someone to hang with me this weekend.\nI know this is super awkward but do you wanna come over?\nSorry I’m kinda bad at making friends.\nThere’s girls I’ve never even said hi to but I know every single Facebook photo they uploaded for the last 2 years.\nNow that I think about it there’s probably like 400 guys who do that with my Facebook.\nAnd probably only like 8 of them speak English.\nSorry, tangent- anyway yeah come over!\nY’know people think I’m boring cause my parents have money but you’d be surprised how crazy shit gets.\nHow crazy? Bitch come to my party and find out!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
